Schematic @PROJECT_VERSION@

Windows: extract the ZIP completely, then run bin\Schematic.exe.
The installer creates a Start-menu shortcut and an uninstaller.
Qt libraries, plugins and the compiler runtime are included.

The ZIP needs no installation, but preferences and user symbol packages still
use the normal per-user Schematic locations; it is not a separate portable profile.
Upgrades and uninstall leave your drawings, preferences and user symbol library alone.
File associations and automatic updates are not included in this release.

Application source is licensed under Apache 2.0; see share/Schematic/licenses.
Qt and its bundled dependencies retain their own licenses. License texts and
available Qt SPDX dependency metadata are included in that directory.
Qt version: @Qt6_VERSION@. Upstream sources: https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/

SVG exports reference installed fonts. Other machines may substitute fonts that
are not installed; font files are not bundled with Schematic or embedded in SVG.
